d future-proofing for businesses. AMD is offering a free loaner program for businesses to test these laptops.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/z7EE9VWKrCA/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-06T19:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"hUvFkmx5K","title":"How to build an AI second brain with Obsidian and Codex","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yke4fLQUsh4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/full-guide-build-an-ai-second-brain-with-codex-huvfkmx5k","summary":"A step-by-step walkthrough for building a personal AI-powered second brain using Codex and Obsidian. The system combines three pillars: a wiki/knowledge base (populated via Obsidian Web Clipper from YouTube, articles, podcasts), a CRM for contact notes, and an AI-grounded journal. Content saved to Obsidian's raw folder is automatically processed by Codex into interlinked wiki pages. Journaling queries are answered using retrieval from the wiki, past journal entries, and CRM data. Automation is set up in Codex to process new files hourly and push backups to a private GitHub repo. The architecture is based on Andrej Karpathy's LLM wiki concept, extended with journaling and CRM layers.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yke4fLQUsh4/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-06T18:19:41.000Z"},{"id":"OvufaVVnk","title":"Victor is an AI coworker that lives inside Slack","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B3vfCHfK2b4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/ai-coworkers-are-officially-here-ovufavvnk","summary":"Victor is an AI coworker that operates natively inside Slack, going beyond simple chatbot interactions to perform multi-step tasks. It can analyze past documents and analytics, generate content outlines, run workflows, call APIs, write and execute code, and produce real deliverables \u2014 all without leaving Slack. Users retain control via an approval step before consequential actions are taken. Use cases span marketing, operations, and engineering teams.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/B3vfCHfK2b4/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-06T13:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"0tNrubSKO","title":"Anthropic Users Are Getting Screwed Over","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WZw8QTXJfjQ","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/anthropic-users-are-getting-screwed-over-0tnrubsko","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WZw8QTXJfjQ/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-04T12:10:37.000Z"},{"id":"XzbQ3Rl3I","title":"Google Just Sold Out","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mwl5rQyCMvA","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/google-just-sold-out-xzbq3rl3i","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Mwl5rQyCMvA/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-03T13:08:32.000Z"},{"id":"clor6Ksbd","title":"Deepseek V4 May Disrupt The Entire AI Economy","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1P3h36Lz5bI","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/deepseek-v4-may-disrupt-the-entire-ai-economy-clor6ksbd","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1P3h36Lz5bI/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-02T12:53:01.000Z"},{"id":"z8ckI25XS","title":"Elon vs. OpenAI Trial Explained","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D0XouckgAt8","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/elon-vs-openai-trial-explained-z8cki25xs","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/D0XouckgAt8/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-01T21:57:20.000Z"},{"id":"Cg9XyFyXx","title":"AI News: 18 Breaking Stories You Missed This Week","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qDI4odijz44","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/ai-news-18-breaking-stories-you-missed-this-week-cg9xyfyxx","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qDI4odijz44/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-01T15:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"9G8pHqOwA","titl